{
  "_comment": [
    "AlphaQuant 多服务编排。改这个文件就能增删服务，不用改代码。",
    "协作模型：每个服务是独立进程；通过文件总线（output/bus/*.jsonl）交换行情与新闻。",
    "  · market      行情服务：连数据源，把 bar 发布到总线，自己不跑策略",
    "  · alpha/beta  策略服务：不连行情源（market_mode=none），从总线订阅 bar 驱动策略",
    "  这样行情采集与策略执行可以各自扩容、各自重启，互不影响。",
    "启动：python main.py hub start   （聚合面板默认 http://127.0.0.1:8899/）",
    "",
    "采集分工：每个服务都装配了同一套采集服务，不开分工就会各采一遍、烧掉多倍配额。",
    "  用服务的 collector 段声明本服务负责哪些标的/类别（见末尾的 fundamental 示例）。",
    "只想临时采一次、不启服务：python main.py ctl collector categories --symbols 600519 --categories fundamental",
    "",
    "健康判定分三层，hub 面板分开显示：进程存活 → 引擎容器 running → 组件无异常。",
    "  只有三层都过才是「健康」；进程在但引擎没起来/组件挂了，会标成「降级运行」。"
  ],
  "hub": { "host": "127.0.0.1", "port": 8899 },
  "state_dir": "output/services",
  "bus_dir": "output/bus",
  "heartbeat_timeout": 15,

  "services": [
    {
      "id": "market",
      "role": "行情服务",
      "enabled": true,
      "port": 8788,
      "mode": "SIMULATE",
      "market_mode": "replay",
      "interval": 0.05,
      "start": "2023-01-01",
      "end": "2024-06-30",
      "data_source": "db",
      "symbols": ["000001"],
      "news": false,
      "monitor": true,
      "snapshot_interval": 5,
      "publish": ["bar"],
      "subscribe": [],
      "autorestart": true,
      "tasks": [],
      "collector": {
        "symbols": ["000001"],
        "with_fundamental": true,
        "with_flow": true,
        "with_chip": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha",
      "role": "策略服务A-双均线",
      "enabled": true,
      "port": 8789,
      "mode": "SIMULATE",
      "market_mode": "none",
      "data_source": "db",
      "news": false,
      "monitor": true,
      "snapshot_interval": 5,
      "publish": [],
      "subscribe": ["bar"],
      "bus_interval": 0.5,
      "autorestart": true,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "task_id": "alpha-ma-000001",
          "name": "双均线-稳健",
          "symbol": "000001",
          "enabled": true,
          "initial_cash": 100000,
          "warmup_bars": 30,
          "sizer": { "type": "percent", "pct": 0.3, "lot_size": 100 },
          "strategy": { "type": "ma_cross", "params": { "fast": 5, "slow": 20 } },
          "risk": [
            { "type": "cooldown", "min_bars": 1 },
            { "type": "cash_reserve" },
            { "type": "position_limit", "max_position_pct": 0.6 },
            { "type": "max_drawdown", "max_drawdown": 0.2 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "beta",
      "role": "策略服务B-RSI+新闻",
      "enabled": true,
      "port": 8790,
      "mode": "SIMULATE",
      "market_mode": "none",
      "data_source": "db",
      "news": false,
      "monitor": true,
      "snapshot_interval": 5,
      "publish": [],
      "subscribe": ["bar", "news"],
      "bus_interval": 0.5,
      "autorestart": true,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "task_id": "beta-rsi-000001",
          "name": "RSI超卖反弹",
          "symbol": "000001",
          "enabled": true,
          "initial_cash": 100000,
          "warmup_bars": 30,
          "sizer": { "type": "percent", "pct": 0.25, "lot_size": 100 },
          "strategy": {
            "type": "combo",
            "entry": {
              "all": [
                { "factor": "rsi", "op": "lt", "value": 35, "params": { "period": 14 } },
                { "factor": "price_position", "op": "lt", "value": 0.5, "params": { "period": 20 } }
              ]
            },
            "exit": { "factor": "rsi", "op": "gt", "value": 65, "params": { "period": 14 } }
          },
          "risk": [
            { "type": "cooldown", "min_bars": 2 },
            { "type": "cash_reserve" },
            { "type": "max_drawdown", "max_drawdown": 0.25 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "task_id": "beta-news-000001",
          "name": "新闻事件驱动",
          "symbol": "000001",
          "enabled": true,
          "initial_cash": 80000,
          "warmup_bars": 30,
          "sizer": { "type": "percent", "pct": 0.2, "lot_size": 100 },
          "strategy": {
            "type": "combo",
            "params": { "use_news_confidence_as_strength": true },
            "entry": "never",
            "exit": "never",
            "event_entry": {
              "all": [
                { "factor": "news_impact", "op": "gt", "value": 0.3 },
                { "factor": "news_confidence", "op": "gte", "value": 0.5 }
              ]
            },
            "event_exit": {
              "all": [
                { "factor": "news_impact", "op": "lt", "value": -0.3 },
                { "factor": "news_confidence", "op": "gte", "value": 0.5 }
              ]
            }
          },
          "risk": [
            { "type": "news_confidence", "min_confidence": 0.5 },
            { "type": "cash_reserve" },
            { "type": "cooldown", "min_bars": 1 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "news",
      "role": "新闻服务（启用前先填 news_config.sources）",
      "enabled": false,
      "port": 8791,
      "mode": "SIMULATE",
      "market_mode": "none",
      "news": true,
      "monitor": true,
      "publish": ["news"],
      "subscribe": [],
      "autorestart": true,
      "tasks": [],
      "news_config": {
        "interval": 60,
        "sources": [ { "type": "rss", "urls": [] } ],
        "analyzers": [ { "type": "keyword" } ]
      },
      "_note": [
        "开启步骤：1) 填 urls（或设环境变量 NEWS_SOURCES）；2) enabled 改 true；3) python main.py hub start",
        "也可以不停 hub 单独起：python main.py hub cmd news start",
        "urls 留空时服务照常启动但一条都不采 —— hub 面板会把它标成「降级运行」而不是健康"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fundamental",
      "role": "基本面采集服务（示例，默认关闭）",
      "enabled": false,
      "port": 8792,
      "mode": "SIMULATE",
      "market_mode": "none",
      "publish": [],
      "subscribe": [],
      "autorestart": true,
      "tasks": [],
      "collector": {
        "enabled": true,
        "ext_enabled": true,
        "symbols": ["600519", "000858"],
        "with_fundamental": true,
        "with_flow": false,
        "with_chip": false,
        "categories": []
      },
      "_note": [
        "采集分工示例：只采基本面，资金流/筹码交给 market 服务，",
        "同一批标的因此不会被采两遍（数据源配额是整台机器共享的）。",
        "把 enabled 改成 true 即启用；symbols 换成你关心的标的。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
